---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Terms" description="Terms for using Easy Garden Plan.">
  <article class="page-shell py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="display-title mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold">Using Easy Garden Plan</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">Last updated September 25, 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 leading-7 text-muted">
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Your account</h2><p class="mt-3">Keep your sign-in details secure and provide accurate information. You are responsible for activity under your account and for using the service lawfully.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Garden and weather guidance</h2><p class="mt-3">Planting dates, forecasts, frost alerts, and recommendations are educational guidance. Gardens and weather vary at small distances, provider data can be delayed, and conditions can change quickly. Check current local conditions and use your judgment before acting.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Free and Pro</h2><p class="mt-3">Free includes the planning features shown on our pricing page. Pro adds active monitoring and alerts. The price and billing period will be shown before checkout, and Stripe processes payments. You may cancel Pro; your saved garden and plan remain available on Free.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Availability and changes</h2><p class="mt-3">We work to keep the service available and the guidance clear, but we cannot promise uninterrupted access or perfect predictions. We may improve or change features and will update these terms when the change affects your use.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Questions</h2><p class="mt-3">Email <a class="font-semibold text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:support@easygardenplan.com">support@easygardenplan.com</a> for service or terms questions.</p></section>
    </div>
  </div></article>
</SiteLayout>
